1
00:01:33,999 --> 00:01:36,840
I'm off! I'm off!

2
00:01:38,269 --> 00:01:41,020
Mokku, be careful out there.

3
00:01:41,716 --> 00:01:43,083
I know!

4
00:01:45,109 --> 00:01:49,120
He's really changed. He's
become so dependable.

5
00:01:52,046 --> 00:01:55,551
Let's see... no, no.

6
00:01:57,099 --> 00:02:00,355
The folks in this village
don't eat anything decent.

7
00:02:01,551 --> 00:02:08,793
Honestly... do they really want us
to starve to death? Good grief... Huh?

8
00:02:08,914 --> 00:02:11,487
How mysterious...

9
00:02:12,519 --> 00:02:14,140
The scent of meat!

10
00:02:16,364 --> 00:02:18,342
You bastard!

11
00:02:18,944 --> 00:02:22,120
Trying to hog it all to
yourself, you damn jerk!

12
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:24,080
I wonder why.

13
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:26,040
Oh, give me a break. Huh?

14
00:02:26,285 --> 00:02:27,420
Here comes Mokku.

15
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:31,600
Where do you think he's heading?

16
00:02:36,460 --> 00:02:40,410
Well, well, well, where
are you off to, little Mokku?

17
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:46,100
Oh, Kenken. I'm going to town for Grandpa
to order some new woodcarving tools.

18
00:02:46,405 --> 00:02:49,346
To town, huh? I wonder why...

19
00:02:49,370 --> 00:02:51,340
Maybe we should tag along with you?

20
00:02:51,655 --> 00:02:54,850
It's all right. I can go
by myself. See you later!

21
00:02:55,405 --> 00:02:59,203
Hmph, he's gotten awfully cocky lately.

22
00:03:02,060 --> 00:03:05,170
Town, huh? Haven't been there in a while.

23
00:03:06,339 --> 00:03:08,174
You thieving cat!

24
00:03:09,230 --> 00:03:12,160
I-I'm a weasel! I wonder why.

25
00:03:18,343 --> 00:03:21,960
This place is amazing.
There's so much stuff here.

26
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:29,580
No, no. Don't get distracted.
Straight to the tool shop.

27
00:03:30,131 --> 00:03:32,514
Let's see, where's the tool shop...

28
00:03:38,870 --> 00:03:40,520
Watch out! Get out of the way!

29
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,528
Clack-clack, that's so cool.

30
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:54,708
But pushing me aside
and not even apologizing...

31
00:03:54,994 --> 00:03:56,360
All right!

32
00:03:58,460 --> 00:03:59,460
Hey, you!

33
00:03:59,660 --> 00:04:00,660
What?

34
00:04:04,124 --> 00:04:06,680
Where is First Street?

35
00:04:07,034 --> 00:04:10,020
How should I know? I
always ride in a carriage.

36
00:04:11,650 --> 00:04:15,270
Hey, that was dangerous!
I almost got hit by a bus!

37
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:19,240
That's because you were
daydreaming, country bumpkin.

38
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,680
What's a country bumpkin?

39
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:22,120
It means an idiot.

40
00:04:22,599 --> 00:04:23,599
What did you say?

41
00:04:24,475 --> 00:04:25,139
Chikaro?

42
00:04:25,192 --> 00:04:26,360
Let's go!

43
00:04:28,230 --> 00:04:30,260
Who on earth was that guy?

44
00:04:30,905 --> 00:04:32,740
First Street isn't that way!

45
00:04:33,755 --> 00:04:36,144
You're supposed to go
straight to the tool shop!

46
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:38,120
That's why I'm looking for the way!

47
00:04:38,275 --> 00:04:40,447
And I'm telling you that's the wrong way!

48
00:04:40,765 --> 00:04:42,309
I can go this way too!

49
00:04:42,580 --> 00:04:45,634
Mokku, the city is full of strange folks.

50
00:04:45,884 --> 00:04:47,395
You'll never get anywhere
if you let them bother you!

51
00:04:47,420 --> 00:04:49,477
Come on, hurry up and finish your errand!

52
00:04:50,225 --> 00:04:55,563
I know that. But he is going somewhere.
I'll keep an eye on him for a bit.

53
00:04:55,780 --> 00:04:57,470
Don't worry, it's going to be okay.

54
00:04:58,270 --> 00:05:00,320
Mokku! You can't do that!

55
00:05:10,915 --> 00:05:13,125
Oh, he's eating it. He
looks just like a human.

56
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:16,072
Madame, please have a seat.

57
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:19,151
Chikaro is as cute as ever.

58
00:05:19,175 --> 00:05:21,640
He's quite a handful with his mischief.

59
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:25,680
Chikaro, go play in the garden for a bit.

60
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:28,100
Yes.

61
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:37,980
Hey, you!

62
00:05:39,365 --> 00:05:42,360
Hey there, country bumpkin. Still lost?

63
00:05:42,510 --> 00:05:46,057
I followed you here.
You're not human, are you?

64
00:05:46,370 --> 00:05:49,600
I am a chimpanzee, an
ape far superior to humans!

65
00:05:49,914 --> 00:05:51,635
Are apes really superior to humans?

66
00:05:51,659 --> 00:05:55,380
Apes were born into this world
long before humans ever were!

67
00:05:56,336 --> 00:06:00,667
But humans can make all kinds
of things and seem to do anything.

68
00:06:00,839 --> 00:06:05,680
Humans just multiply like rats and
do everything through sheer numbers.

69
00:06:05,783 --> 00:06:11,579
We ape kind prefer living peacefully in
Mother Nature. Who are you, anyway?

70
00:06:12,250 --> 00:06:13,250
You're made of wood, huh?

71
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:18,838
Yeah. Just a wooden puppet.
Though I want to become a human.

72
00:06:18,862 --> 00:06:20,967
Why would a puppet want to become a human?

73
00:06:21,610 --> 00:06:25,183
Huh? Do you have any idea how
much puppets get made fun of?

74
00:06:25,540 --> 00:06:27,257
Hmm, I-I see.

75
00:06:27,281 --> 00:06:29,116
If you became a real human...

76
00:06:29,140 --> 00:06:32,500
...no, something even greater than
human, everyone would be amazed.

77
00:06:32,707 --> 00:06:35,132
Forget being more than human,
just being human is enough!

78
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:39,146
You know so much, so
please, teach me about humans.

79
00:06:39,945 --> 00:06:42,118
I really don't like dealing
with troublesome things.

80
00:06:42,204 --> 00:06:43,120
Hey wait!

81
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:46,343
There's no greater teacher than you!

82
00:06:46,890 --> 00:06:48,200
Please!

83
00:06:48,604 --> 00:06:49,740
Take me as your apprentice...

84
00:06:58,389 --> 00:07:00,759
I'm pretty strict. Are you sure about this?

85
00:07:04,808 --> 00:07:06,808
I'm so glad I came to town!

86
00:07:07,714 --> 00:07:09,159
Thief!

87
00:07:09,237 --> 00:07:11,644


88
00:07:13,820 --> 00:07:14,666


89
00:07:14,690 --> 00:07:16,512
You idiot! Run, quick!

90
00:07:16,552 --> 00:07:17,712
Right away, Boss!

91
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,346
Wait!

92
00:07:19,129 --> 00:07:20,129
Boss!

93
00:07:20,562 --> 00:07:22,695
Wait up!

94
00:07:23,770 --> 00:07:24,902
Hanaguro, wait!

95
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,000
That's enough!

96
00:07:28,170 --> 00:07:30,260
I'm sorry, they got away.

97
00:07:31,975 --> 00:07:32,975
Who are you?

98
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,460
I'm Mokku. Starting today,
I'm Mr. Chikaro's apprentice.

99
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:38,840
Chikaro's apprentice?

100
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,520
Yes.

101
00:07:42,267 --> 00:07:45,511
Well, how interesting. All right.

102
00:07:45,731 --> 00:07:50,320
If you're Chikaro's apprentice, you're
more than welcome. Come on inside.

103
00:07:50,850 --> 00:07:52,260
I humbly accept.

104
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:23,159
What on earth are you doing?
This is how you play the piano.

105
00:08:53,339 --> 00:08:55,110
Such wonderful music.

106
00:09:03,918 --> 00:09:05,860
This is the power of amateur music!

107
00:09:07,696 --> 00:09:11,427
This is the primal cry.
The rhythm of our ape clan.

108
00:09:28,079 --> 00:09:29,079
Stop it!

109
00:09:32,724 --> 00:09:34,927
Stop that! Such vulgar music!

110
00:09:37,439 --> 00:09:39,923
You've been a bad boy lately, haven't you?

111
00:09:40,319 --> 00:09:43,077
Isn't it because you took this
strange puppet as an apprentice?

112
00:09:47,489 --> 00:09:48,990
Making me out to be the bad guy...

113
00:09:49,014 --> 00:09:51,615
Acting so refined when
you don't know anything...

114
00:09:52,225 --> 00:09:54,711
Seriously! We were just having fun!

115
00:09:57,526 --> 00:09:58,959
I'm sorry...

116
00:09:59,061 --> 00:10:02,760
You get carried away way too easily.
You'll never rule the world like that.

117
00:10:03,155 --> 00:10:04,460
Go cool your head!

118
00:10:11,709 --> 00:10:13,613
What does "rule the world" mean?

119
00:10:18,265 --> 00:10:20,380
And what good does cooling my head do?

120
00:10:27,329 --> 00:10:28,620
Oh, you guys!

121
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:31,815
Hey, Hanaguro, Mokku's
got some real skill, doesn't he?

122
00:10:31,910 --> 00:10:37,210
Sure does. Managed to slip
right into a huge mansion.

123
00:10:37,235 --> 00:10:39,569
And when you think
about it, that's thanks to us.

124
00:10:39,593 --> 00:10:41,193
Right, Mokku? You get that, don't you?

125
00:10:42,147 --> 00:10:47,480
Cause we pulled off that theft back
then, you get to live such a nice life.

126
00:10:47,944 --> 00:10:50,200
What did you guys come to town for?

127
00:10:50,355 --> 00:10:53,659
There are lots of humans in town.
Lots of humans means lots of food.

128
00:10:54,259 --> 00:10:55,440
I wonder why.

129
00:10:55,820 --> 00:10:58,982
Then why don't you go
look for food in town?

130
00:10:59,660 --> 00:11:01,236
This is someone else's place.

131
00:11:01,450 --> 00:11:03,840
But isn't this your home, too?

132
00:11:04,345 --> 00:11:07,077
I am Chikaro's apprentice, after all.

133
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,925
"I'm the ape's apprentice!" he says!

134
00:11:10,950 --> 00:11:12,360
You'd better cool off!

135
00:11:12,660 --> 00:11:14,092
I did cool off.

136
00:11:14,241 --> 00:11:16,560
He's crazy about that pretentious ape!

137
00:11:17,115 --> 00:11:19,280
Apes are totally outdated!

138
00:11:19,510 --> 00:11:21,320
Outdated? That's not true!

139
00:11:21,378 --> 00:11:23,500
Yeah, that's right! Prepare yourself!

140
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:25,407
They can't run as fast as us...

141
00:11:25,431 --> 00:11:27,558
...their senses aren't sharp, and
they don't even blow foul air!

142
00:11:27,679 --> 00:11:31,640
Besides, when we die, we leave our
hides behind. What the hell do they do?

143
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,101
So that makes you guys better?

144
00:11:34,505 --> 00:11:38,440
Naturally. How about you
bring us something to eat?

145
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:39,880
No way!

146
00:11:41,879 --> 00:11:45,180
Hey, Boss, should we use our usual trick?

147
00:11:45,436 --> 00:11:46,108


148
00:11:56,218 --> 00:11:57,438
No, don't...

149
00:11:59,866 --> 00:12:01,973
Hey, I hear Mokku is weak against fire!

150
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:03,503
If you don't bring us food...

151
00:12:03,527 --> 00:12:07,150
...this house might just burn down
while you and the ape are asleep!

152
00:12:07,748 --> 00:12:08,994


153
00:12:12,092 --> 00:12:16,882
Getting three meals a day for us
should be easy enough, right, little Mokku?

154
00:12:17,629 --> 00:12:20,320
A-All right. I'll bring it.

155
00:12:20,605 --> 00:12:24,131
Our hideout is behind the flowerbed. 
We'll be waiting, Mokku.

156
00:12:37,689 --> 00:12:39,640
Where could Mokku have gone?

157
00:12:40,605 --> 00:12:45,100
Did he get lost, or did
someone take him away?

158
00:12:46,999 --> 00:12:49,508
It was too much for him to go alone...

159
00:12:50,118 --> 00:12:53,100
Yes, I'll go to town, too.

160
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:04,146
Today we're going to the Countess's party.

161
00:13:04,889 --> 00:13:07,300
Let's get dressed up real nice and go.

162
00:13:07,989 --> 00:13:10,325
Mokku, get the bath ready for Chikaro.

163
00:13:13,689 --> 00:13:17,233
I heard foxes and weasels
run faster than you.

164
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:21,380
So what? Lower animals are the
ones that have to run and jump around.

165
00:13:22,055 --> 00:13:24,478
They prey on anything weaker than them...

166
00:13:24,502 --> 00:13:27,715
...and have to run for their lives the
moment they see something stronger.

167
00:13:28,254 --> 00:13:31,385
So that's why they're always
running away in such a hurry.

168
00:13:31,565 --> 00:13:32,565
They?

169
00:13:32,685 --> 00:13:35,700
Yeah, some old acquaintances of mine.

170
00:13:43,089 --> 00:13:44,775
Don't waste your time on worthless fools.

171
00:13:44,909 --> 00:13:47,640
We're going to become a species
more advanced than humans.

172
00:13:48,785 --> 00:13:50,463
I just want to be human.

173
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,129
Aim higher.

174
00:13:52,490 --> 00:13:54,640
I don't care about aiming high,
I just want to quit doing this.

175
00:13:54,805 --> 00:13:56,220
You've gotten quite rebellious lately.

176
00:13:56,899 --> 00:14:00,636
It's not that, but are apes
really better than humans?

177
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:02,476
Are you mocking me?

178
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:04,947
No, no, of course not...

179
00:14:05,424 --> 00:14:06,861
I'll be right back.

180
00:14:09,569 --> 00:14:11,979
Something's off with that Mokku.

181
00:14:23,569 --> 00:14:25,460
Let's go. Mokku, not bad, huh?

182
00:14:29,860 --> 00:14:32,460
Boss, Mokku brought it.

183
00:14:32,609 --> 00:14:36,640
Oh, Mokku, good job, good job.

184
00:14:37,189 --> 00:14:38,580
Here, it's cake.

185
00:14:39,205 --> 00:14:41,200
Boss, what about drinks?

186
00:14:41,740 --> 00:14:45,001
Oh, right. Hey, there's wine, isn't there?

187
00:14:45,025 --> 00:14:45,839
I'm not sure.

188
00:14:46,014 --> 00:14:49,715
It should be in the cellar. You know
what'll happen if you don't bring it.

189
00:14:52,349 --> 00:14:53,520
All right.

190
00:14:53,700 --> 00:14:54,700


191
00:15:13,796 --> 00:15:14,920
Thank you.

192
00:15:17,589 --> 00:15:20,391
Ah, so that's what you're doing. No good.

193
00:15:20,635 --> 00:15:22,986
Quit whining and bring us more!

194
00:15:37,408 --> 00:15:38,416
Here he comes! Come on!

195
00:15:44,049 --> 00:15:47,565
Mokku! You were working with
those thieves the whole time!

196
00:15:48,283 --> 00:15:49,424
Time to run!

197
00:15:50,197 --> 00:15:51,150
Hey wait!

198
00:15:51,175 --> 00:15:52,565
I won't let you escape.

199
00:15:52,682 --> 00:15:54,518
No, that's not true! Those guys, they—

200
00:15:54,619 --> 00:15:56,619
Quiet, you! Shut your
mouth and come with me!

201
00:15:57,057 --> 00:15:59,643
- There's an explanation for this!
- Save your excuses!

202
00:16:00,502 --> 00:16:02,799
You've got it wrong, I'm
not working with them!

203
00:16:03,117 --> 00:16:04,847
Chikaro! Help!

204
00:16:05,319 --> 00:16:07,672
Chikaro please! Chikaro!

205
00:16:13,965 --> 00:16:15,780
Help me! Come on, listen to me!

206
00:16:16,025 --> 00:16:18,480
You really tricked your way
into this house, didn't you!

207
00:16:18,790 --> 00:16:22,520
Just wait, I'll toss you into the fireplace
along with the junk! Prepare yourself!

208
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:28,947
That's the thing! They said they'd burn the
whole house down, so I gave them food...

209
00:16:29,213 --> 00:16:31,140
As if I'd fall for such a cheap act!

210
00:16:31,539 --> 00:16:34,940
I'd rather throw it away than
feed petty thieves like them!

211
00:16:35,899 --> 00:16:37,056
Damn it...

212
00:16:39,599 --> 00:16:41,800
Mokku, how are your accommodations?

213
00:16:42,909 --> 00:16:44,360
Chikaro! Let me out, hurry!

214
00:16:44,870 --> 00:16:48,480
Ending up as firewood is
your destiny. Just give up.

215
00:16:48,700 --> 00:16:51,780
Won't you even try to save your apprentice?

216
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:55,460
I was a fool to trust a wooden puppet.

217
00:16:56,260 --> 00:16:59,920
Now then, I'll head to the party
and tease those noble ladies.

218
00:17:00,669 --> 00:17:02,180
Chikaro! Help me!

219
00:17:02,605 --> 00:17:05,220
Chikaro! Chikaro!

220
00:17:26,844 --> 00:17:31,749
Don't cry, little lady. I'll
scold him soundly later.

221
00:17:31,773 --> 00:17:32,798
Shall we dance?

222
00:17:49,557 --> 00:17:51,283
Up we go...shh!

223
00:17:53,857 --> 00:17:55,580
Hey, wake up already!

224
00:17:57,139 --> 00:17:59,140
Who gave you permission to come here?

225
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:03,040
Filthy bastard! I won't even
speak to him! You talk to him!

226
00:18:03,264 --> 00:18:06,120
Right! My mother was getting on my case!

227
00:18:06,446 --> 00:18:09,928
She told me if I'm not around, she'll
starve, so I'd better hurry up and go!

228
00:18:10,015 --> 00:18:13,282
Idiot! What are you talking about?!

229
00:18:13,490 --> 00:18:15,140
Next time, you bring the food!

230
00:18:15,759 --> 00:18:16,991
Like hell I'd do that for you!

231
00:18:17,697 --> 00:18:20,893
Don't act so high and
mighty, you ape bastard!

232
00:18:21,325 --> 00:18:22,325
Shall we get him?

233
00:18:22,799 --> 00:18:24,020
Get him!

234
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:28,540
Stop that at once!

235
00:18:28,889 --> 00:18:29,920
Shut up!

236
00:18:50,474 --> 00:18:51,315
This is terrible!

237
00:18:51,544 --> 00:18:53,480
They've come for revenge!

238
00:19:07,099 --> 00:19:08,149
Damn it...

239
00:19:12,264 --> 00:19:13,822
What is it?

240
00:19:16,279 --> 00:19:17,380
Boss!

241
00:19:18,844 --> 00:19:20,080
Goodbye!

242
00:19:20,104 --> 00:19:21,514
I wonder why.

243
00:19:22,311 --> 00:19:25,653
How dare you humiliate me at the party!

244
00:19:25,881 --> 00:19:28,516
In the end, you're
nothing but a savage ape.

245
00:19:29,126 --> 00:19:31,700
You're better suited as a circus clown.

246
00:19:42,009 --> 00:19:47,380
Damn it, let me out of the shed!
What's your problem? This is awful!

247
00:19:49,705 --> 00:19:54,380
I don't want this! I don't want
to be sold to the circus! Stop it!

248
00:19:54,969 --> 00:19:57,300
Am I going to be burned?

249
00:20:09,300 --> 00:20:09,969
Mokku!

250
00:20:10,549 --> 00:20:11,690
By apprenticing to an ape...

251
00:20:12,659 --> 00:20:14,275
...did you become a bit more like one?

252
00:20:15,073 --> 00:20:18,720
No! I'm going to become human!
Hurry and take off these chains!

253
00:20:18,864 --> 00:20:21,720
Just mimicking the look and
shape of a human is not enough.

254
00:20:22,859 --> 00:20:24,052
Strength is a good example.

255
00:20:24,810 --> 00:20:25,926
Do you understand?

256
00:20:26,179 --> 00:20:28,085
Then what am I supposed to do?

257
00:20:28,454 --> 00:20:29,755
You must not rush.

258
00:20:30,224 --> 00:20:31,960
You need to build yourself up step by step.

259
00:20:32,779 --> 00:20:34,060
What do you mean, step by step?

260
00:20:34,559 --> 00:20:37,720
You must experience many
things and learn about the world.

261
00:20:38,649 --> 00:20:40,788
And once you learn to
tell right from wrong...

262
00:20:40,812 --> 00:20:42,820
...you will be able
to become human.

263
00:20:43,739 --> 00:20:48,400
It will be hard. But you
must never give up, Mokku.

264
00:21:07,919 --> 00:21:09,940
I don't want to be in the circus.

265
00:21:10,139 --> 00:21:13,963
You're good at the piano and acrobatics,
the circus audience will love you.

266
00:21:14,104 --> 00:21:15,340
No, no way!

267
00:21:16,279 --> 00:21:20,521
I'll be burned to ashes before
I ever find a human heart.

268
00:21:39,468 --> 00:21:41,696
This is a fine ape!

269
00:21:52,619 --> 00:21:55,160
Well then, Madame, I'll be taking the ape.

270
00:21:55,575 --> 00:21:57,078
Take him away already.

271
00:21:57,227 --> 00:22:02,880
Looking at such a filthy ape will
upset my sweet little Marianne. Right?

272
00:22:07,374 --> 00:22:11,420
I don't want to be a circus
freak! Mokku, do something!

273
00:22:12,386 --> 00:22:13,605
Mokku...

274
00:22:15,544 --> 00:22:18,940
No, no! Save me, Mokku!

275
00:22:19,554 --> 00:22:22,898
Mokku! Mokku!

276
00:22:28,419 --> 00:22:31,211
Chikaro, you're full of energy, aren't you?

277
00:22:33,818 --> 00:22:34,839
Miss!

278
00:22:37,040 --> 00:22:40,517
Don't treat animals like toys.
Please truly care for them.

279
00:22:53,719 --> 00:22:56,360
Mokku, is that you, Mokku?

280
00:22:58,084 --> 00:22:59,443
Grandpa.

281
00:23:02,360 --> 00:23:03,360
Mokku.

282
00:23:06,719 --> 00:23:10,940
It's all right now. I don't
like seeing that sad face.

283
00:23:11,929 --> 00:23:13,440
Cheer up, Mokku.

284
00:23:14,180 --> 00:23:15,180
Grandpa!

285
00:23:16,749 --> 00:23:19,482
I'm sorry. I'm so useless.

286
00:23:20,144 --> 00:23:23,940
Grandpa made it back, 
so there's no need to worry.

287
00:23:25,899 --> 00:23:28,009
Grandpa!

288
00:23:33,189 --> 00:23:36,240
<i>Mokku makes friends with an orphaned chick.</i>

289
00:23:36,962 --> 00:23:42,320
<i>To Mokku, this lonely baby
stork feels just like a little brother.</i>

290
00:23:43,400 --> 00:23:46,335
<i>One day, the chick is shot and wounded...</i>

291
00:23:46,625 --> 00:23:49,278
<i>...but survives thanks to the
tender care of Mokku and his friends.</i>

292
00:23:50,199 --> 00:23:53,031
<i>Yet as the chick grows day by day...</i>

293
00:23:53,305 --> 00:23:57,980
<i>...it is destined to grow up and
journey to its distant homeland.</i>

294
00:23:58,614 --> 00:24:01,180
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku!</i>

